  "scope": "Actual nonempty finite forest ranked-parse representation and forbidden-class/image calibration for the canonical family {P4,C4,Comp(U): U in the given finite forest family}. This is a canonical application supplier, not the full lemma for arbitrary finite forbidden graph families containing P4 and C4. No effective ideal construction is asserted.",
